OL,3,GNEWSABells to be removed from listed
OL,4,Achurch
OL,5,
OL,6,FA set of eight bells will be
OL,7,Fpermanently removed from a Grade
OL,8,FII-listed church to allow for repairs
OL,9,Fand potential reuse elsewhere.
OL,11,FPlans submitted by the Durham Diocese
OL,12,FBoard of Finance in August, to remove
OL,13,Fthe bells from St Mary's Church in
OL,14,FSouth Hylton, have been approved by
OL,15,FSunderland City Council.
OL,17,FAn accompanying heritage statement
OL,18,Fnoted the church has closed as an
OL,19,Fofficial place of worship due to a
OL,20,Fdeclining congregation and is in a
OL,21,F"use-seeking period."
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
