OL,3,GNEWSABells to be removed from listed
OL,4,Achurch
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning documents said it was likely
OL,7,Fthe bells would be removed to another
OL,8,Fchurch or used to train bell ringers at
OL,9,Fan alternative venue, stating either
OL,10,Foption would mean they were "available
OL,11,Fto the public to hear".
